# Boost on 27's end save (run.py hgss_boost: np_save4 set-move on a member already in the party).
# The den's whirlpool (13..15,36..38) stands between its entrance and the shrine, and 27's boost took Feraligatr's
# Whirlpool for Ice Beam. PELIPPER (slot 4; HM05 among its hms, files/poketool/personal/personal.json) carries it
# instead, over Blizzard: Feraligatr keeps Ice Beam and Dragon Pulse for the dragons ahead.
party-move 4 3 MOVE_WHIRLPOOL
